      "side": 1,
      "message": "Changed mempool cache behaviour explained in dpdk v26.07 release notes: https://doc.dpdk.org/guides/rel_notes/release_26_07.html\n\nThe mempool cache flush/refill algorithm was improved to reduce the cache miss rate for most application types.\nThe effective size of a mempool cache was changed to match the specified size at mempool creation; the effective size was previously 50% larger than requested.\nApplications where each lcore only puts or gets to a mempool should adapt by doubling their configured mempool cache size to avoid doubling their mempool cache miss rate.\n\nFollowing the DPDK v26.07 guidance, double the default num-mbufs to 32768 ?",
